    <string name="sec_privacy">Privacy</string>
    <string name="privacy_text">Scanning, duplicate detection and junk detection run entirely on your phone. AI analysis sends file metadata (names, folders, sizes, types, dates) to the provider you choose, in batches; file content is only sent when you enable content analysis for a run. API keys are encrypted with the Android Keystore and never logged. Nothing is backed up or sent anywhere else.</string>

